#: kviewviewer/kviewviewer.cpp:88
msgid ""
"Could not find a suitable Image Canvas! This probably means, that you didn't "
"install KView properly."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu pronaći odgovarajući Image Canvas! Ovo vjerovatno znači da niste "
"ispravno instalirali KView."

#: kviewviewer/kviewviewer.cpp:90
msgid ""
"Accessing the KImageViewer interface of the Image Canvas failed. Something "
"in your setup is broken (a component claims to be a KImageViewer::Canvas but "
"it's not)."
msgstr ""
"Pristupanje KImageViewer interfejsu za Image Canvas nije uspjelo. Nešto "
"nije u redu sa vašim postavkama (komponenta tvrdi da je "
"KImageViewer::Canvas ali nije)."

